Redesign this existing Next.js (App Router, Tailwind) website for "Bridge AI", a Nairobi-based technology company. It is currently a web-design studio site called "Astra Design"; reposition it as a full tech solutions company: CCTV, monitoring rooms, networking, access control & biometrics, software, and data/system services. Keep the existing project structure and routes where possible. I have attached the logo PNG.

BRAND
- Logo: attached PNG (navy "bridge" + blue "a" + green "i" with a green arch above "ai"). Use the colour version on white; never place it on dark backgrounds except in an optional dark footer variant using the white logo.
- Colours: navy #0D0B24 (text/headings), blue #3B8DE8 (primary accent, links, icons), green #2FD07A (secondary accent, badges, highlights), light blue #E6EFFC (accent bands), page background #FFFFFF, card background #F5F7FB, body text #3A4150.
- Fonts (Google Fonts via next/font): Quicksand 600/700 for headings and logo-adjacent text, Manrope 400–800 for body.
- Style: clean, white, minimal, generous spacing, rounded cards (10–12px radius), thin borders #DDE3EE, no dark hero, no gradients, no stock-looking illustrations. Mobile-first; must look excellent on phones since most traffic comes from WhatsApp links.

NAVBAR
- Logo left. Links: Home, Services, Products, Projects, Contact. Right: green "WhatsApp us" button linking to https://wa.me/254799960446. Sticky, white, subtle bottom border. Hamburger menu on mobile.

HOME PAGE SECTIONS (in order)
1. Hero: H1 "Connecting your business to smarter security & technology". Sub: "CCTV, networking, access control and software, supplied, installed and supported by one team." Buttons: "Get a quote" (to /contact) and "View our services". Right side: a photo slot (I'll supply a monitoring-room video wall photo, use /images/videowall.jpg). Small green pill: "5+ active clients".
2. Partner strip (light blue band): "AUTHORISED PARTNER" label + "Dahua · Hikvision · Hanwha" in bold; right side "We also supply: Ubiquiti · Cisco · ZKTeco · Ruijie". Use text, not brand logos.
3. Services grid (6 cards, 3 columns desktop, 1 column mobile), each with a simple line icon (lucide-react), title and 3 bullet points:
   - CCTV & Surveillance: IP cameras, NVRs & DVRs / Remote viewing on your phone / Smart AI motion analytics
