   - Software: Websites & web apps / ERP systems / Mobile apps
   - Data & Systems: Data migrations / System upgrades / System redesigns
4. Products teaser: 3 cards linking to /products: "CCTV cameras explained", "Camera catalogue (Hanwha, Hikvision, Dahua)", "Access control & biometrics".
5. Quality section: heading "Quality you can see. Support you can count on." with 4 check-mark points: Genuine, warrantied equipment / Neat, professional installation / Your team trained at handover / After-sales support. Two photos beside it (/images/dome.jpg, /images/rack.jpg).
6. Projects preview: grid of 4 photos from /images (videowall, cabinet, rack, dome) with short captions, plus existing software projects (Swift Styles Shop, CareCrest Nursing) as cards. Link "View all projects" to /projects.
7. Downloads: two cards with download buttons: "Company brochure (PDF)" → /downloads/Bridge-AI-Brochure-A4.pdf and "Hardware & product guide (PDF)" → /downloads/Bridge-AI-Hardware-Product-Guide.pdf.
8. CTA band (light blue): "Not sure what fits your site? Tell us, and we'll recommend the right setup." with Call and WhatsApp buttons.
9. Remove the testimonials section entirely (I will add real ones later). Remove the stats counters.

